+# Invoice review
+
+## Purpose
+
+This service identifies invoice anomalies for an operator to review by comparing an invoice total with an expected total.
+
+## Behavior
+
+The current source reports the numeric difference between the totals and marks the invoice as requiring operator review when the totals differ.
+
+## Boundaries
+
+The service does not approve payment or change an invoice.
+
+The repository does not establish how invoice review is invoked, how results reach the operator, or any persistence or external integration behavior.
